 * pigpio servo control of two SG90 servos.
 *
 * Wiring:
 *   Water valve servo signal  -> GPIO17 (physical pin 11)
 *   Water valve servo power    -> 5 V (pin 2 or 4)
 *   Water valve servo GND      -> GND (pin 6)
 *   Directional nozzle servo signal -> GPIO18 (physical pin 12)
 *   Directional nozzle servo power -> 5 V (pin 2 or 4)
 *   Directional nozzle servo GND  -> GND (pin 6)
 *
 * Build:  gcc -Wall -Wextra -O2 -o watering watering.c -lpigpio -lrt
 * Run:    sudo ./watering
